WEBVTT

00:13.320 --> 00:15.030
Prince Ning, Xiao Changmin,

00:15.590 --> 00:17.390
has long coveted the throne.

00:18.480 --> 00:21.830
He instructed a foreign lady in his
manor to keep a rare foreign poison.

00:22.870 --> 00:25.160
I discovered Prince Ning's
treasonous intentions,

00:25.160 --> 00:26.640
and urged him to turn back.

00:27.070 --> 00:29.120
But he tried to murder me to silence me.

00:29.640 --> 00:31.280
I barely managed to escape,

00:32.070 --> 00:34.150
but the child in my womb lost its life.

00:35.790 --> 00:38.150
Prince Ning,
fearing his crimes would be exposed,

00:38.880 --> 00:40.920
drank poison and killed himself
in his manor.

00:42.000 --> 00:43.880
I beg Your Majesty for justice,

00:45.000 --> 00:47.000
and allow me and Prince Ning

00:48.150 --> 00:50.240
to sever all ties.

02:10.528 --> 02:11.360
=Blossoms of Power=

02:11.360 --> 02:14.260
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:14.340 --> 02:17.300
=Episode 27=

02:17.870 --> 02:18.840
Changmin

02:18.912 --> 02:20.992
committed suicide out of fear
of punishment?

02:22.870 --> 02:26.240
The Imperial Guard found some things
in Prince Ning's Manor.

02:26.560 --> 02:29.680
But it is not my place to say more.

02:30.430 --> 02:32.470
The Empress Dowager
and His Majesty invite you

02:32.470 --> 02:34.150
to Yong'an Hall for a talk,
Your Highness.

02:37.800 --> 02:39.710
Greetings, Father, Grandmother.

02:41.800 --> 02:42.960
You may rise.

02:44.400 --> 02:45.030
Father,

02:45.504 --> 02:47.568
why did Changmin
take poison and kill himself?

02:48.150 --> 02:49.400
Do not call him Changmin.

02:49.870 --> 02:50.910
For so many years,

02:51.190 --> 02:52.190
all of us

02:52.310 --> 02:53.800
have been kept in the dark.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.360
The rare poison in the palace back then

02:56.680 --> 02:59.680
came from the hands
of the foreign lady in his manor.

03:02.680 --> 03:03.750
This woman

03:03.750 --> 03:05.360
is skilled in using rare poisons,

03:05.910 --> 03:07.710
and has been hiding
in Prince Ning's Manor

03:07.800 --> 03:09.280
for over ten years.

03:13.310 --> 03:14.400
She has confessed

03:14.840 --> 03:16.430
that she was instructed by Changmin.

03:21.220 --> 03:22.500
(Confession of the Guilty Slave, Yi Sha)

03:22.500 --> 03:24.660
(Prince Ning ordered me to make a rare poison,
a trace amount can make one wish for death.)

03:27.460 --> 03:30.180
(Signature: Yi Sha)

03:31.190 --> 03:32.750
The cherry cheese from back then

03:34.280 --> 03:37.080
was poisoned by Changmin?

03:39.680 --> 03:41.470
He coveted the position of Crown Prince

03:42.000 --> 03:43.310
and harbored resentment.

03:44.430 --> 03:47.680
Knowing you liked to eat cherry cheese,

03:48.430 --> 03:50.000
he made this vicious move.

03:51.560 --> 03:54.190
Afterwards,
he even showed concern for you.

03:54.710 --> 03:56.080
Thinking about it now,

03:56.430 --> 03:58.430
it truly makes one shudder.

03:58.960 --> 04:01.710
To think the murderer
was my second prince,

04:02.310 --> 04:04.470
he was actually so ruthless!

04:05.430 --> 04:07.150
It truly chills my heart.

04:09.000 --> 04:11.000
Did that foreign lady
confess it herself?

04:25.300 --> 04:29.220
(Clarity and Serenity)

04:42.040 --> 04:42.750
Your Highness.

04:45.000 --> 04:45.680
Your Highness.

04:47.630 --> 04:49.000
Do you feel

04:49.168 --> 04:50.992
that Prince Ning
is not the real culprit?

04:56.240 --> 04:57.830
Changmin's so-called suicide

04:58.128 --> 05:00.144
doesn't seem like the act
of the real culprit.

05:00.560 --> 05:02.480
He seems more like
a pawn being manipulated.

05:09.000 --> 05:10.560
The real mastermind behind the scenes

05:11.630 --> 05:13.560
is still within these four palace walls.

05:16.100 --> 05:19.460
(Prince Xin's Manor)

05:24.830 --> 05:26.000
Brother-in-law, you're back.

05:26.240 --> 05:28.070
I asked the kitchen
to stew some ginseng soup.

05:28.070 --> 05:29.390
It will be brought over shortly.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.070
What are you doing here?

05:34.032 --> 05:35.552
I have absolutely nothing to do

05:35.920 --> 05:37.070
with Prince Ning anymore.

05:38.115 --> 05:39.240
I feel like

05:39.390 --> 05:41.240
a wandering ghost.

05:41.600 --> 05:42.310
Actually,

05:43.240 --> 05:45.390
I've always considered your place
as my own home.

05:46.480 --> 05:48.000
You were once my second sister-in-law.

05:49.480 --> 05:50.680
For you to come here

05:52.190 --> 05:53.190
is against propriety.

05:53.360 --> 05:55.480
I have absolutely
no improper thoughts now.

05:57.190 --> 05:58.600
I just want to be your sister,

05:59.552 --> 06:01.800
and beg for a little pity
and protection from you.

06:03.480 --> 06:04.430
You no longer have

06:04.830 --> 06:06.070
any connection with this place.

06:08.310 --> 06:09.000
Go back.

06:28.600 --> 06:29.630
The doctor said

06:30.560 --> 06:32.360
I lost too much blood
from the miscarriage,

06:33.120 --> 06:35.070
and my body hasn't fully recovered yet.

06:35.750 --> 06:37.120
I still have matters to attend to.

06:37.296 --> 06:39.136
I'll have someone escort you back later.

06:39.680 --> 06:40.430
Brother-in-law.

06:47.390 --> 06:49.830
Thank you for granting
my brother's marriage, Your Majesty.

06:50.360 --> 06:51.310
You may rise.

06:52.190 --> 06:53.120
Xihe,

06:53.120 --> 06:54.360
I know very well

06:54.830 --> 06:55.830
that your father

06:57.240 --> 07:00.430
had always been considering
the future of you and your brother.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.120
I just wanted

07:02.360 --> 07:04.800
to fulfill this wish for your father.

07:05.240 --> 07:07.720
The Xue family has been
a literary family for generations,

07:08.000 --> 07:10.390
and they are also very happy
with this marriage.

07:12.040 --> 07:12.750
I am

07:13.504 --> 07:15.120
able to fulfill this beautiful union,

07:16.000 --> 07:17.360
which brings me great comfort.

07:18.680 --> 07:20.040
I requested an audience today

07:20.480 --> 07:21.920
to implore you

07:21.920 --> 07:23.280
to allow me to return to northwest

07:23.344 --> 07:25.360
to attend my brother's wedding,
Your Majesty.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.270
Granted.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.920
It is only natural for siblings

07:29.240 --> 07:30.390
to share a deep bond.

07:30.800 --> 07:33.040
However, it is a long
and arduous journey.

07:33.630 --> 07:34.480
Xihe,

07:34.830 --> 07:37.190
I will send an elite squad
to escort you.

07:38.120 --> 07:40.560
Return to the East Palace
and plan carefully.

07:40.920 --> 07:43.040
Choose an auspicious day to depart.

07:44.192 --> 07:46.040
Thank you for your grace, Your Majesty.

07:46.580 --> 07:53.380
(Cultivate Virtue
and Practice Righteousness)

07:58.460 --> 07:59.300
(Imperial Capital)

07:59.310 --> 08:00.850
From the imperial capital to northwest,

08:00.880 --> 08:02.560
first to Shanzhou, then to Lanzhou,

08:02.630 --> 08:04.060
and finally to Yaozhou.

08:04.224 --> 08:05.720
The route follows the official road

08:05.920 --> 08:07.360
with post stations at every stop.

08:10.784 --> 08:12.360
The official road is the safest.

08:13.750 --> 08:15.190
Are you also going to northwest?

08:19.430 --> 08:20.750
Father said I am frail

08:21.190 --> 08:22.560
and cannot endure a long journey.

08:23.310 --> 08:24.600
Father is right.

08:25.120 --> 08:27.488
Just stay in the capital
and wait for my return.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.600
Father has sent guards to escort me,

08:29.870 --> 08:31.800
and I have Mo Yu and Mo Yuan with me.

08:31.840 --> 08:33.504
You don't need to worry too much.

08:37.984 --> 08:38.848
Your Highness,

08:38.850 --> 08:41.280
His Majesty has approved
Crown Princess's return to northwest

08:41.390 --> 08:42.752
to attend her brother's wedding.

08:42.760 --> 08:43.936
She will depart tomorrow.

09:01.060 --> 09:07.180
(Taoran Inn)

09:10.510 --> 09:11.120
Madam,

09:11.390 --> 09:13.360
this is your premium room.

09:13.670 --> 09:14.750
If you need anything,

09:14.750 --> 09:16.120
just call for me anytime.

09:27.390 --> 09:28.870
Your Highness.

09:37.200 --> 09:38.510
Greetings, Crown Princess.

09:39.440 --> 09:41.080
Why are you here?

09:43.320 --> 09:45.870
I am on official duty
to inspect Shanzhou.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.200
Perhaps...

09:49.720 --> 09:51.150
Perhaps it is the will of Heaven

09:51.168 --> 09:52.970
that we happen
to be traveling the same way.

09:53.000 --> 09:54.000
It truly is destiny.

09:55.360 --> 09:57.080
Whether by the will of Heaven
or by reason,

09:57.550 --> 10:00.030
there is no destiny between us.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.630
Since you are here on official duty,

10:02.960 --> 10:04.390
let's pretend we never met.

10:04.624 --> 10:07.552
We will go our separate ways
and not interfere with each other.

10:08.840 --> 10:09.510
Farewell.

11:15.390 --> 11:16.200
Zhen Zhu,

11:17.080 --> 11:18.200
help me comb my hair.

12:28.670 --> 12:31.000
My princess, are you satisfied?

12:32.440 --> 12:33.270
Your Highness!

12:36.870 --> 12:37.910
What are you doing here?

12:43.030 --> 12:44.790
I haven't seen my wife for days.

12:45.720 --> 12:46.910
I couldn't help myself,

12:47.630 --> 12:49.000
so I sneaked out of the palace.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.200
If you are angry,

12:53.910 --> 12:54.910
you may punish me.

12:57.670 --> 12:58.750
Leave.

13:03.120 --> 13:04.630
You wouldn't let me come with you,

13:05.904 --> 13:07.910
yet you had Changqing
protect you all the way.

13:09.320 --> 13:11.480
Prince Xin is on official duty.

13:11.632 --> 13:13.180
We just happen to be going the same way.

13:13.440 --> 13:15.000
Why are you so petty?

13:15.870 --> 13:16.750
Official duty?

13:18.440 --> 13:19.550
Do you really believe that?

13:19.632 --> 13:21.072
Is he really on official duty?

13:24.000 --> 13:24.510
Who is it?

13:24.800 --> 13:25.870
It's been a tiring journey.

13:26.870 --> 13:28.510
I've prepared some pastries for you.

13:29.328 --> 13:30.790
Please have a taste, Crown Princess.

13:33.550 --> 13:34.910
Thank you for your kindness.

13:35.360 --> 13:36.784
But I have already gone to bed.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.080
This is

13:41.360 --> 13:42.480
perilla and smoked plum cake.

13:43.670 --> 13:45.320
It was my late consort's
favorite pastry.

13:46.128 --> 13:47.776
She has been gone for four years.

13:48.064 --> 13:50.030
I've kept Nanny Li in the manor
all this time.

13:50.848 --> 13:52.030
Every year on her birthday,

13:52.840 --> 13:54.080
I have Nanny Li

13:54.480 --> 13:55.550
make this pastry for her.

13:56.032 --> 13:57.750
That was your late consort's preference,

13:58.000 --> 13:58.790
not mine.

13:59.152 --> 14:01.480
I've disliked the taste of perilla
since I was a child.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.270
You, get out.

14:10.128 --> 14:12.560
I was just afraid
that being away for so long,

14:12.960 --> 14:14.360
you would miss this taste.

14:14.750 --> 14:15.790
Get out.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.550
Hurry.

14:21.150 --> 14:21.960
I'm not leaving.

14:22.910 --> 14:24.910
Get out.

14:26.750 --> 14:27.440
Are you alright?

14:28.270 --> 14:29.120
I'm fine.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.120
I just...

14:51.520 --> 14:53.712
The Crown Princess has already changed
and gone to bed.

14:53.790 --> 14:55.360
Please head back for now, Your Highness.

14:57.000 --> 14:59.670
Then please give these pastries

15:00.000 --> 15:01.360
to the Crown Princess for me.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.630
Thank you, Your Highness.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.080
Prince Xin!

15:22.080 --> 15:24.270
How could you barge
into my room without permission?

15:25.750 --> 15:27.200
I just heard a strange noise.

15:27.790 --> 15:28.600
It's late.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.480
I need to rest.

15:30.240 --> 15:31.240
To avoid any suspicion

15:31.440 --> 15:32.870
and protect both our reputations,

15:33.550 --> 15:35.120
please leave immediately.

15:55.200 --> 15:56.720
You didn't tell him I was here.

15:58.120 --> 15:59.320
Were you worried about me,

16:00.270 --> 16:01.320
or him?

16:03.240 --> 16:04.720
I was worried about myself.

16:10.590 --> 16:13.260
♪Amidst the flickering lights♪

16:14.620 --> 16:17.330
♪Alone for several autumns♪

16:18.720 --> 16:21.170
♪How to choose the one♪

16:21.550 --> 16:25.110
♪To be with forever?♪

16:26.190 --> 16:29.480
♪When I gaze upon you♪

16:30.110 --> 16:33.450
♪Flower petals twirl gently in my heart♪

16:34.050 --> 16:35.510
♪Gracefully♪

16:36.220 --> 16:41.280
♪For all eternity♪

16:41.720 --> 16:44.370
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

16:44.950 --> 16:48.560
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

16:49.730 --> 16:52.470
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

16:52.930 --> 16:56.770
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

16:57.710 --> 17:00.550
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

17:00.950 --> 17:04.560
♪Are gently gathered
into your elegant sleeves♪

17:05.670 --> 17:08.430
♪Gradually, on the misty path♪

17:08.800 --> 17:12.730
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

17:28.070 --> 17:29.200
Your Highness,

17:29.936 --> 17:31.440
you always like to show up uninvited.

17:31.680 --> 17:33.920
Some people are always so stubborn,

17:34.680 --> 17:35.680
so distracted.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.070
But I'm different from you.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.510
You went through all the trouble

17:40.160 --> 17:42.310
to escort your sister-in-law
from far away.

17:42.880 --> 17:44.240
As her husband,

17:44.440 --> 17:45.440
I am deeply grateful.

17:46.000 --> 17:46.720
What?

17:48.240 --> 17:49.200
Are you upset?

17:50.350 --> 17:51.270
Why would I be?

17:52.590 --> 17:54.920
Watching my rival get harshly rejected
by my beloved wife,

17:55.160 --> 17:56.240
I couldn't be happier.

18:02.240 --> 18:03.440
I have plenty of time

18:04.640 --> 18:05.480
to stay by her side,

18:06.070 --> 18:06.960
protect her,

18:08.920 --> 18:10.350
and wait for her to change her mind.

18:10.680 --> 18:11.680
But you, Crown Prince,

18:13.880 --> 18:14.920
your days are numbered.

18:19.070 --> 18:19.830
It's getting late.

18:21.070 --> 18:22.790
Xihe is still waiting
for me to go to bed.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.110
Take care, Changqing.

19:01.960 --> 19:02.880
It's been a bumpy ride.

19:02.944 --> 19:03.990
You should get some rest.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.640
You look exhausted.

19:17.030 --> 19:17.960
If you refuse to sleep,

19:18.208 --> 19:20.320
I'll have the carriage turn back
to the posthouse,

19:20.330 --> 19:22.480
and wait for you to catch up on sleep
before we leave.

19:31.830 --> 19:32.400
Your Highness,

19:32.790 --> 19:34.640
Prince Xin has been following us
on horseback.

19:35.070 --> 19:35.830
Should we stop him?

19:38.240 --> 19:38.790
No need.

20:02.340 --> 20:07.220
(A Feast Under the Sky)

20:11.000 --> 20:12.750
Come on,
let's drink to our hearts' content!

20:12.750 --> 20:13.200
- Yeah!

20:13.310 --> 20:14.110
Men,

20:14.350 --> 20:14.790
come on.

20:15.030 --> 20:18.000
Eat and drink well tonight!

20:18.010 --> 20:18.790
- Cheers!
- Come on!

20:18.790 --> 20:19.680
Drink up! Cheers!

20:19.680 --> 20:20.240
Come on.

20:20.240 --> 20:20.960
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

20:20.960 --> 20:21.350
Let's toast!

20:21.350 --> 20:21.720
Cheers!

20:21.830 --> 20:22.480
Bottoms up!

20:22.480 --> 20:22.980
- Cheers!
- Let's toast!

20:23.000 --> 20:24.640
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

20:26.960 --> 20:28.224
Let me propose a toast as well.

20:28.460 --> 20:29.550
(Geng Liangcheng,
Deputy General of Northwest Army)

20:29.550 --> 20:30.550
In just three days,

20:30.576 --> 20:32.200
it will be Young Master Shen's wedding.

20:32.480 --> 20:34.680
This is a joyous occasion
for the entire northwest!

20:35.000 --> 20:36.880
Today, my brothers and I

20:37.240 --> 20:39.830
want to properly celebrate
for the Young Master!

20:40.240 --> 20:43.104
We won't leave until we're drunk!

20:43.184 --> 20:44.416
We won't leave until we're drunk!

20:44.432 --> 20:46.110
- Congratulations, Duke!
- Congratulations, Duke!

20:46.110 --> 20:48.230
- Congratulations, Young Master!
- Congratulations, Young Master!

20:49.088 --> 20:50.990
Thank you for your warm hospitality,
Uncle Geng.

20:51.030 --> 20:52.440
And thank you, Generals.

20:52.640 --> 20:53.160
Bottoms up!

20:53.240 --> 20:54.110
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

20:54.110 --> 20:55.232
- Bottoms up!
- Cheers!

20:57.510 --> 20:58.160
Another round.

20:58.160 --> 21:00.096
You must have a few more drinks,
Young Master.

21:00.400 --> 21:00.960
Come.

21:01.392 --> 21:02.790
Have a drink with the Young Master.

21:02.790 --> 21:03.540
Come, Young Master.

21:03.550 --> 21:04.030
Come.

21:04.040 --> 21:05.030
- Cheers.
- Congratulations!

21:05.030 --> 21:05.880
Congratulations!

21:06.200 --> 21:06.640
Come.

21:06.768 --> 21:08.440
- We are all brothers.
- Come, cheers.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.480
- Come on.
- Come.

21:12.000 --> 21:12.640
Duke,

21:12.720 --> 21:13.632
let me fill your cup.

21:14.030 --> 21:14.640
Duke.

21:14.640 --> 21:15.720
Fill it up.

21:16.070 --> 21:16.880
Come, bottom's up.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.270
- We won't leave until we're drunk.
- Let's drink.

21:18.270 --> 21:19.030
- Cheers.
- Great.

21:20.790 --> 21:21.270
Cheers.

21:22.736 --> 21:24.350
- Fill them up.
- Everyone, drink up.

21:26.740 --> 21:28.590
- We won't leave until we're drunk.
- Come on.

21:28.624 --> 21:29.240
Fill it up.

21:31.070 --> 21:31.830
Cheers.

21:31.830 --> 21:32.830
All right.

21:33.680 --> 21:34.720
Assassins!

22:11.350 --> 22:11.880
Hurry!

22:13.310 --> 22:14.350
Hurry! Go!

22:14.350 --> 22:15.240
- Hurry!
- There are guards at the city gate.

22:15.240 --> 22:16.288
Engage the enemy at once!

22:21.790 --> 22:22.350
Keep up!

22:30.720 --> 22:32.590
- Guards!
- Guards!

22:33.790 --> 22:34.750
Where is everyone?

22:34.750 --> 22:35.900
(Tingxi City)

22:37.472 --> 22:38.750
Where are the city guards?

22:38.960 --> 22:39.680
Where did they go?

22:55.400 --> 23:00.830
- Kill them!
- Kill them!

23:46.070 --> 23:46.830
Father!

23:47.510 --> 23:48.070
Father!

23:48.070 --> 23:48.590
Duke!

23:49.030 --> 23:49.750
Duke!

24:00.590 --> 24:01.510
Uncle Geng?

24:02.880 --> 24:03.750
Geng Liangcheng!

24:04.000 --> 24:06.240
You shameless traitor,
colluding with the Le tribe!

24:06.240 --> 24:07.270
Despicable scoundrel!

24:07.350 --> 24:08.960
How dare you plot against the Duke?

24:08.960 --> 24:10.750
We won't let you off even as ghosts!

24:10.750 --> 24:11.550
Shen Yueshan.

24:12.200 --> 24:14.110
Do you remember my son, Zhongji?

24:16.920 --> 24:20.000
You personally ordered
his beheading back then.

24:20.550 --> 24:22.680
Today, I will kill all of you

24:23.000 --> 24:24.590
to be buried with my son!

24:24.720 --> 24:25.480
Yun'an,

24:26.000 --> 24:26.880
leave me.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.160
Take everyone and go!

24:28.160 --> 24:28.750
Father,

24:29.200 --> 24:30.440
I won't leave you behind.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.680
Soldiers!

24:32.680 --> 24:33.440
- Here!
- Here!

24:33.440 --> 24:35.270
Defend the Duke to the death!

24:35.270 --> 24:37.872
- Defend the Duke to the death!
- Defend the Duke to the death!

24:38.830 --> 24:40.440
Fire!

24:43.440 --> 24:44.440
Father!

24:51.000 --> 24:53.270
How are my father and brother doing now?

24:53.790 --> 24:54.680
At the critical moment,

24:54.690 --> 24:56.880
fortunately, General Yan,
who was stationed outside the city,

24:56.890 --> 24:57.510
arrived in time.

24:57.520 --> 24:58.670
He broke through the city gates

24:58.680 --> 25:00.310
and saved the Duke and the Young Master.

25:02.256 --> 25:03.920
The Young Master was shot by an arrow,

25:04.000 --> 25:05.160
but his life is not in danger.

25:05.830 --> 25:08.270
The Duke suffered internal injuries
and lost a lot of blood.

25:08.920 --> 25:10.070
He is still unconscious.

25:13.790 --> 25:14.480
Mo Yuan,

25:14.640 --> 25:15.720
take my token.

25:16.110 --> 25:18.440
Immediately send men
to the prefectures around Tingxi City

25:18.560 --> 25:19.920
to gather all renowned physicians

25:20.240 --> 25:21.400
to treat the Duke.

25:21.960 --> 25:22.440
Understood.

25:23.936 --> 25:24.960
Set off immediately.

25:24.992 --> 25:26.110
We must arrive by tomorrow.

25:26.200 --> 25:26.752
Understood.

25:43.660 --> 25:48.860
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

26:01.160 --> 26:03.000
How is my father's condition now?

26:03.960 --> 26:05.550
The Duke's injuries are too severe.

26:05.640 --> 26:07.720
Although his life is saved for now,

26:08.310 --> 26:10.510
he remains in a coma.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.350
My father's health

26:16.960 --> 26:18.200
will be in your hands.

26:18.640 --> 26:20.750
I will do my utmost.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.550
I want to go see my brother.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.960
You should go rest for a while.

26:30.960 --> 26:31.720
I'm not tired.

26:33.830 --> 26:34.550
Yun'an,

26:35.640 --> 26:36.680
Father needs you.

26:37.480 --> 26:38.590
Northwest needs you, too.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.830
You must recover well.

26:42.960 --> 26:43.880
Don't worry, Xihe.

26:44.736 --> 26:46.790
The Le tribe soldiers
who infiltrated the city

26:46.880 --> 26:48.550
have all been wiped out by General Yan.

26:48.720 --> 26:50.270
The city defenses have been redeployed.

26:50.550 --> 26:53.000
The various units of Northwest Army
have been assembled,

26:53.000 --> 26:54.368
standing by in full readiness.

26:54.880 --> 26:56.160
So the traitor

26:56.920 --> 26:58.160
is really Geng Liangcheng?

27:03.960 --> 27:05.110
I saw it with my own eyes.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.590
I remember

27:09.110 --> 27:11.000
he used to brave life and death
with Father,

27:11.040 --> 27:12.496
sharing his trials and tribulations.

27:13.200 --> 27:15.088
He was also your first teacher
in martial arts

27:15.088 --> 27:16.400
and military strategy.

27:17.200 --> 27:19.790
Uncle Geng and his wife
have always cared for us deeply.

27:20.790 --> 27:22.310
I really can't understand

27:23.110 --> 27:24.480
how he could become a traitor.

27:25.720 --> 27:26.480
It's because of

27:27.640 --> 27:28.640
Geng Zhongji.

27:29.510 --> 27:30.790
Uncle Geng's only son?

27:32.640 --> 27:34.830
Geng Zhongji went missing
when he was young,

27:35.200 --> 27:36.680
and was only found two years ago.

27:37.310 --> 27:39.920
But he had already become a man
of corrupt morals,

27:40.096 --> 27:42.928
running roughshod over the town
and treating human life like dirt.

27:43.400 --> 27:46.270
Geng Liangcheng and his wife
felt guilty toward him,

27:46.680 --> 27:48.270
often using money to bail him out,

27:49.350 --> 27:50.920
which only fueled his evil deeds.

27:51.200 --> 27:52.680
Father enforced the law impartially

27:53.350 --> 27:55.480
and had Geng Zhongji beheaded in public.

27:57.070 --> 27:59.680
Geng Liangcheng and his wife
were devastated.

28:00.750 --> 28:02.350
But after a period of silence,

28:02.920 --> 28:05.030
they treated Father and me
the same as before.

28:06.070 --> 28:07.240
Thinking about it now,

28:07.830 --> 28:09.000
how could the two of them

28:09.160 --> 28:10.830
truly hold no grudges?

28:12.790 --> 28:14.030
I think this matter

28:14.128 --> 28:16.200
is not as simple as just
seeking personal revenge.

28:17.960 --> 28:19.110
You mean...

28:19.350 --> 28:20.790
If it were just for personal revenge,

28:20.816 --> 28:22.736
Father had his guard completely down
around him.

28:22.740 --> 28:24.016
If he assassinated him secretly,

28:24.048 --> 28:25.710
his chances of success
would be much higher.

28:25.720 --> 28:27.400
But instead,
he colluded with the Le tribe

28:27.410 --> 28:28.688
to slaughter northwest's soldiers,

28:28.690 --> 28:31.400
and even attempted to wipe out
the leaders of all units at once.

28:32.070 --> 28:33.590
This is a blatant seizure of power.

28:54.270 --> 28:55.510
You've stayed up too late.

28:56.350 --> 28:57.240
Get some sleep.

29:02.160 --> 29:04.070
Yun'an has his hands full right now,

29:04.310 --> 29:05.480
and he's heavily injured.

29:06.510 --> 29:07.960
I want to help him take care

29:08.070 --> 29:09.640
of the matters in the rear camp.

29:27.040 --> 29:28.350
If you collapse from exhaustion,

29:29.160 --> 29:30.440
how would Father and Yun'an

29:31.030 --> 29:32.070
feel about it?

29:34.200 --> 29:35.480
I'm being too impatient.

29:36.200 --> 29:37.350
You're right.

29:38.640 --> 29:39.960
I should get some rest.

29:41.552 --> 29:43.264
I'll go get you some soothing incense.

30:14.720 --> 30:15.720
Along the way,

30:16.400 --> 30:18.550
you haven't let your guard down
for a moment.

30:19.440 --> 30:20.680
Just listen to me now.

30:20.704 --> 30:22.576
Close your eyes and get some good rest.

30:23.640 --> 30:24.400
I'll stay with you.

31:22.400 --> 31:23.072
Who's there?

31:26.110 --> 31:27.070
General Geng,

31:27.920 --> 31:29.070
I hope you've been well.

31:32.510 --> 31:33.750
Your Highness.

31:37.960 --> 31:38.880
In this battle,

31:39.110 --> 31:40.200
you fought beautifully.

31:41.480 --> 31:43.160
Although Shen Yueshan didn't die,

31:43.720 --> 31:46.110
both father and son
are now severely injured.

31:46.750 --> 31:47.920
And the Le army

31:48.160 --> 31:49.880
will continue to arrive
in endless streams.

31:50.790 --> 31:51.680
The Shen family

31:52.160 --> 31:53.590
will fall sooner or later.

31:56.480 --> 31:59.510
Do you know the Crown Prince and Crown
Princess have arrived in Tingxi City?

32:00.920 --> 32:03.030
You haven't even figured out
your own situation,

32:03.480 --> 32:05.350
yet you're already scheming
on my behalf.

32:07.790 --> 32:09.240
They came at the perfect time.

32:10.880 --> 32:11.920
What I've been waiting for

32:14.240 --> 32:15.590
is this exact moment.

32:37.640 --> 32:39.070
You look displeased.

32:39.790 --> 32:40.830
What's the matter?

32:51.550 --> 32:52.590
The war in northwest

32:53.400 --> 32:55.240
was originally a sure victory for me.

32:55.590 --> 32:57.510
But the Crown Prince,
at this critical moment,

32:58.350 --> 32:59.550
rushed to Tingxi City.

33:03.376 --> 33:05.504
Just because you're facing
the Crown Prince,

33:06.310 --> 33:07.830
you feel you have no chance of winning?

33:17.960 --> 33:18.750
Changtai,

33:20.200 --> 33:22.400
how long do we have to live in fear?

33:23.480 --> 33:24.880
Can't you just let it go?

33:29.680 --> 33:32.160
The other princes are Father's sons.

33:33.590 --> 33:35.310
Some receive his favor,

33:36.070 --> 33:37.790
some are groomed by him,

33:37.790 --> 33:39.160
and one is his heir.

33:39.510 --> 33:40.750
Why am I the only one

33:40.830 --> 33:43.200
who is just a disposable pawn
in his chess game?

33:44.720 --> 33:46.310
I want to make him regret

33:46.960 --> 33:49.110
always looking down on me

33:49.550 --> 33:50.680
and using me!

33:56.128 --> 33:58.352
When my family was ruined
and I was left destitute,

33:59.310 --> 34:00.640
you agreed to marry me

34:01.880 --> 34:03.400
and treated me like a treasure.

34:04.880 --> 34:06.160
Such kindness,

34:07.264 --> 34:09.392
I will never forget until the day I die.

34:11.550 --> 34:12.800
But your desire for power

34:12.800 --> 34:14.400
has never ceased.

34:14.784 --> 34:16.670
Before,
I was willing to take the blame for you,

34:16.688 --> 34:18.000
hoping you would repent.

34:18.670 --> 34:20.320
But in front of His Majesty,

34:20.960 --> 34:22.630
you drank the so-called poisoned liquor,

34:23.590 --> 34:25.230
playing the part of a devoted husband

34:25.230 --> 34:26.630
to cover up your ambition.

34:28.960 --> 34:31.190
Now you're even colluding
with foreign enemies to rebel.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.190
Changtai,

34:37.590 --> 34:39.510
it's not too late for us to stop now.

34:40.800 --> 34:42.190
If we stop fighting for power,

34:42.360 --> 34:44.550
wouldn't it be nice
to live a peaceful life?

34:47.710 --> 34:49.110
But I can't accept that.

34:55.320 --> 34:57.150
This is our only chance.

34:58.400 --> 34:59.590
No matter what,

35:00.840 --> 35:02.760
I have to take this gamble.

35:18.510 --> 35:19.440
I understand.

35:21.710 --> 35:22.760
I shouldn't have

35:24.480 --> 35:26.440
expected anything from someone

35:27.880 --> 35:29.550
who is driven mad by power.

35:46.630 --> 35:48.000
Just be a good Princess Consort.

36:01.880 --> 36:04.630
Geng Liangcheng has colluded
with the Le tribe army to mutiny

36:04.630 --> 36:05.960
and attempt a rebellion.

36:06.190 --> 36:09.280
The Duke of Wei and his son
are severely injured.

36:10.150 --> 36:12.030
Especially the Duke of Wei,

36:12.030 --> 36:14.030
who remains unconscious to this day.

36:14.630 --> 36:15.550
Minister Tao,

36:16.400 --> 36:18.000
where is the Crown Prince now?

36:18.510 --> 36:20.480
The Crown Prince and Crown Princess

36:20.800 --> 36:23.150
have arrived at Tingxi City.

36:23.150 --> 36:24.480
Reporting to Your Majesty,

36:24.710 --> 36:26.360
Prince Lie requests an audience.

36:26.880 --> 36:27.510
Send him in.

36:32.400 --> 36:35.440
Father, Changqing is handling
official business in Dianzhou.

36:35.450 --> 36:36.960
Upon learning
of Geng Liangcheng's mutiny,

36:37.000 --> 36:38.960
he sent a carrier pigeon asking me
to request an edict on his behalf.

36:39.030 --> 36:40.390
He implores you to issue an order,

36:40.400 --> 36:42.670
allowing him to dispatch
the troops stationed in Yaozhou

36:42.680 --> 36:44.528
to support northwest
and quell the rebellion.

36:45.400 --> 36:46.360
Your Majesty,

36:46.630 --> 36:49.070
among the garrisons
in the nearby prefectures,

36:49.360 --> 36:52.550
the one in Yaozhou is the most valiant
and battle-tested.

36:53.000 --> 36:54.960
If they march through the mountain pass,

36:55.150 --> 36:57.150
they can also arrive the fastest.

36:58.840 --> 36:59.440
Granted.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.150
Changying,

37:01.230 --> 37:02.710
deliver my edict immediately.

37:02.736 --> 37:04.440
Order him to do everything in his power

37:04.440 --> 37:06.550
to protect the Crown Prince
and Crown Princess,

37:06.880 --> 37:09.230
and ensure the safety
of the people in northwest.

37:09.670 --> 37:10.710
I obey your command.

37:24.670 --> 37:25.710
I'm truly tired.

37:26.840 --> 37:29.230
Making the wrong choice
leads to a path of no return.

37:29.230 --> 37:30.760
No!

37:32.760 --> 37:35.070
I once promised you
that if there ever came a day

37:35.120 --> 37:36.496
when I fell in love with you,

37:37.150 --> 37:38.480
I would tell you immediately.

37:39.070 --> 37:40.150
Xiao Huayong,

37:40.590 --> 37:41.952
I love you.

37:47.190 --> 37:50.130
♪I've hidden so many words♪

37:50.750 --> 37:53.550
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

37:54.420 --> 38:01.390
♪So never uncover♪

38:01.580 --> 38:03.940
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:05.070 --> 38:07.800
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:08.760 --> 38:14.100
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

38:15.860 --> 38:18.680
♪Every answer I gave♪

38:19.480 --> 38:22.330
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

38:23.120 --> 38:26.490
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

38:26.750 --> 38:30.060
♪How hard it truly was?♪

38:33.030 --> 38:36.470
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

38:37.460 --> 38:39.790
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

38:41.060 --> 38:46.820
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

38:48.230 --> 38:51.360
♪It's a shame I never could♪

38:51.810 --> 38:54.820
♪Give you a moon in return♪

38:54.930 --> 39:01.570
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:01.570 --> 39:05.240
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:06.110 --> 39:08.870
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:09.310 --> 39:12.440
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:12.880 --> 39:18.830
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:20.230 --> 39:23.780
♪You'll never♪

39:24.060 --> 39:33.530
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

39:59.700 --> 40:03.180
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
